                    ),
                  ),
                  SizedBox(width: _fs(6)),
                  Expanded(
                    child: Container(
                      height: 0.7,
                      color: DunesColors.resolve(
                        context,
                        LhColors.line2,
                        role: DunesColorRole.surface,
                      ),
                    ),
                  ),
                  SizedBox(width: _fs(6)),
